#!/bin/sh
# `mydraw` command of the installed app (Contents/Resources/bin/mydraw; scripts/install-app.mjs
# links ~/.local/bin/mydraw here). Runs bin/mydraw.mjs with the app's own binary in Node mode, so
# no Node install is needed. See bin/mydraw.mjs.
SELF=$(readlink -f "$0") || exit 1
RES=$(cd "$(dirname "$SELF")/.." && pwd) || exit 1
ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1 exec "$RES/../MacOS/mydraw" "$RES/bin/mydraw.mjs" "$@"
